    <string name="lane_zoom_mapbox_standard_note">The Mapbox standard camera keeps its own zoom.</string>
    <string name="lane_details_title">Lane details on the map</string>
    <string name="lane_details_note">Lane markings, painted arrows and crosswalks where Mapbox has them: major highways and some cities. The car shows where you are on the road, not which lane you are in; the lanes to use are in the card. The route line can hide under bridges.</string>

